    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/f0f282cd3f64835eb13afa2062c43397.avif?t=1726218583\" width=478 height=85 /></span><br>The core objective of the game revolves around skill enhancement and character development. The game begins with a simple premise: escape the dungeon. However, as you delve deeper into its mechanics, you realize that this is no ordinary escape. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/25cb54182b7029bb50bfef7d273a3790.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/25cb54182b7029bb50bfef7d273a3790.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/25cb54182b7029bb50bfef7d273a3790.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Each level pushes you to strategically enhance your character\u2019s skills, making them stronger, faster, and more resilient. The true test comes when you\u2019ve maxed out your character\u2019s potential and the high-score mode is unlocked. Here, the game shifts gears from survival to glory as you strive to rack up as many points as possible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/664f807390d1b463f2f9b1e267acaa95.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/664f807390d1b463f2f9b1e267acaa95.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/664f807390d1b463f2f9b1e267acaa95.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Movement in the game is both intuitive and critical. The game teaches you that movement is not just a means of travel but a survival tool. Each decision to move or stay put can mean the difference between victory and defeat. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/615522235089ed159f070063ab727492.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/615522235089ed159f070063ab727492.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/615522235089ed159f070063ab727492.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>It is more than just a shooter game; it\u2019s a test of skill, strategy, and reflexes. It challenges you to think ahead, move wisely, and build your character into a formidable force. It\u2019s a testament to how engaging gameplay mechanics can elevate the entire gaming experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/ac4ed608f83a01af5a49e1fd04a76dde.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/ac4ed608f83a01af5a49e1fd04a76dde.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/ac4ed608f83a01af5a49e1fd04a76dde.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>This game was designed and tested in ultrawide (UWQHD) up to a resolution of 3440 x 1440.<br><br><strong><u>ZomGoBo Key Features</u></strong><br>- Sharpen your skills and conquer the dungeon's relentless horde!<br>- Unleash your fully-powered character in a furious high-score battle!<br>- Master the fluid movement mechanics: aim, move, and sprint to outmaneuver the enemy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/d96d568694cf6caaeffa24e4fd1abb87.avif?t=1726218583\" width=551 height=666 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/f0f282cd3f64835eb13afa2062c43397.avif?t=1726218583\" width=478 height=85 /></span><br>The core objective of the game revolves around skill enhancement and character development. The game begins with a simple premise: escape the dungeon. However, as you delve deeper into its mechanics, you realize that this is no ordinary escape. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/25cb54182b7029bb50bfef7d273a3790.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/25cb54182b7029bb50bfef7d273a3790.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/25cb54182b7029bb50bfef7d273a3790.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Each level pushes you to strategically enhance your character\u2019s skills, making them stronger, faster, and more resilient. The true test comes when you\u2019ve maxed out your character\u2019s potential and the high-score mode is unlocked. Here, the game shifts gears from survival to glory as you strive to rack up as many points as possible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/664f807390d1b463f2f9b1e267acaa95.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/664f807390d1b463f2f9b1e267acaa95.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/664f807390d1b463f2f9b1e267acaa95.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Movement in the game is both intuitive and critical. The game teaches you that movement is not just a means of travel but a survival tool. Each decision to move or stay put can mean the difference between victory and defeat. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/615522235089ed159f070063ab727492.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/615522235089ed159f070063ab727492.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/615522235089ed159f070063ab727492.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>It is more than just a shooter game; it\u2019s a test of skill, strategy, and reflexes. It challenges you to think ahead, move wisely, and build your character into a formidable force. It\u2019s a testament to how engaging gameplay mechanics can elevate the entire gaming experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/ac4ed608f83a01af5a49e1fd04a76dde.poster.avif?t=1726218583\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/ac4ed608f83a01af5a49e1fd04a76dde.webm?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/ac4ed608f83a01af5a49e1fd04a76dde.mp4?t=1726218583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>This game was designed and tested in ultrawide (UWQHD) up to a resolution of 3440 x 1440.<br><br><strong><u>ZomGoBo Key Features</u></strong><br>- Sharpen your skills and conquer the dungeon's relentless horde!<br>- Unleash your fully-powered character in a furious high-score battle!<br>- Master the fluid movement mechanics: aim, move, and sprint to outmaneuver the enemy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975190/extras/d96d568694cf6caaeffa24e4fd1abb87.avif?t=1726218583\" width=551 height=666 /></span>",
